      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Orchestration Tool Hardening Gaps",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Surfaces",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `coordination` - `checkpoint` - `validate` - `session_lifecycle` - `receipt_index` - lane / worktree / promotion scripts",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Current Role",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `coordination` manages claims, leases, artifacts, and handoffs. - `checkpoint` creates governed local commits. - `validate` now acts as the read-only readiness gate. - `receipt_index` summarizes content-light evidence.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Current Risk",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "These surfaces can become new mutation channels if they are not anchored to hardened mutation and validation tools.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Hardening Gaps",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Boundary enforcement** - Orchestration should not directly mutate unless it routes through hardened surfaces.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "2. **Evidence lineage** - Orchestration should emit receipts or indexable evidence when it changes state.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "3. **Dirty workspace respect** - Orchestration should preserve user-owned dirty files and fail closed on ambiguous state.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "4. **Schema consistency** - Coordination, checkpoint, and validate should share a receipt and blocker vocabulary where possible.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "5. **Promotion discipline** - Promotion should rely on validate plus evidence indices, not ad hoc shell checks.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Priority",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Orchestration hardening is second-order:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- finish mutation tools first - then harden inspection tools - then enforce orchestration prerequisites",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Safe Usage Rule",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Do not let orchestration become a shortcut around hardened mutation or validation surfaces.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
